## Rules when the vault is unavailable

- Read `CLAUDE.md` (Claude Code) or `AGENTS.md` (other agents) first.
- Treat the Obsidian vault as the canonical home for implementation plans and
  handoffs. Do not create standalone plan mirrors in the repo.
- If you must record something while the vault is down, add a dated note to this file
  only, tell the user the vault was unavailable, and sync it into Obsidian as soon as
  the vault is back.
